[http://www.wunderland.com/WTS/Kory/Games/Zendo/|Zendo] is an inductive reasoning/guessing game similar to [http://www.logicmazes.com/games/eleusis.html|Eleusis], [http://www.pagat.com/eights/mao.html|Mao] and [http://www.archimedes-lab.org/mastermind.html|Mastermind].

Zendo is played with stackable plastic pyramids; see [http://www.wunderland.com/WTS/Kory/Games/Zendo/HowToPlay.html|The Zendo Rules] for more information.

This is not (yet) an attempt to translate the rules, but merely to translate the more commonly used terms in the game so it can be played fairly easily by people speaking Lojban.

Emphasis is on correctness rather than emulating the pseudo-buddhistic poetics of the original.

All unusual words should be in jbovlaste; [mailto:rlpowell@digitalkingdom.org|bug me] if they're not.

Feel free to replace words with links to their jbovlaste pages.

No implication that rules below are good is intended.

;koan:le/lo mupli
;master:la/doi ctuca
;rule (as in the rule the master has in mind):le javni
;A koan has the buddha nature if it contains ...:da poi mupli cu mapti le javni gi'o gunma ...
;A pyramid:mumbli, sort of.  In fact, a Zendo pyramid is something like "bliku lo slasi vo plita kubli be li re bei li ci .e pa kevna kubli be li re bei li vo"
;A pyramid, easy version:lo/le dacti  :-)
;Contains only red pieces:gunma po'o lo xunre dacti
;Contains at least one red piece:gunma su'o xunre dacti
;Contains exactly one red piece:gunma pa xunre dacti
;Contains at least one stack:gunma su'o derxi
;Equivalently, contains at least one piece which is on top of another piece:gunma su'o dacti poi cpana su'o dacti
;Equivalently, contains at least one piece which is beneath another piece:gunma su'o dacti poi se cpana su'o dacti
;Contains exactly one stack with at least one red piece in it:gunma pa derxi poi gunma su'o xunre dacti
;Contains only pieces of one colour:gunma po'o lo dacti poi simxu mintu lo ka skari
;Contains only pieces of one colour, another way:gunma po'o lo dacti poi se skari pa da
;Contains only red or blue pieces:gunma po'o su'o xunre dacti .a su'o blanu dacti
;Contains only red or blue pieces, another way:gunma no dacti poi na se skari lo xunre .a lo blanu
;Contains only two colours of pieces:gunma po'o re se skari be lo dacti
;Contains only two colours of pieces, another way:gunma po'o lo dacti poi se skari re da